WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 38]

01:45.220 --> 01:46.060
Luo Ge,

01:46.940 --> 01:48.500
look at the world.

01:49.490 --> 01:50.580
People intrigue against

01:50.580 --> 01:51.660
each other.

01:51.740 --> 01:52.900
They are jealous of the talents

01:52.900 --> 01:54.160
and dissipate rumors.

01:54.900 --> 01:55.660
Luo Ge,

01:55.940 --> 01:56.940
you're wrong.

01:57.700 --> 01:59.940
It's not me that made the world like this,

01:59.940 --> 02:01.580
but people raised me

02:02.220 --> 02:03.420
with their desires.

02:04.580 --> 02:05.690
The peace and joy you want

02:05.690 --> 02:06.950
can only last a moment.

02:07.180 --> 02:08.699
You can't control

02:08.699 --> 02:10.220
chaos and darkness.

02:10.380 --> 02:11.260
Get lost!

02:24.540 --> 02:26.260
Go away!

02:27.900 --> 02:29.620
Go away!

02:32.460 --> 02:34.180
Get lost!

02:42.740 --> 02:44.600
You are still struggling, Luo Ge.

02:44.980 --> 02:46.260
Your perseverance

02:46.260 --> 02:48.590
is as great as that of God of the Moonlight.

02:49.340 --> 02:50.420
But even God of the Moonlight

02:50.420 --> 02:52.300
was defeated by me.

02:54.220 --> 02:55.340
What can you do?

03:00.700 --> 03:01.900
You're just an evil spirit harming the mortal world

03:01.900 --> 03:03.860
in Three Realms.

03:04.620 --> 03:06.460
How dare you call yourself that?

03:07.380 --> 03:08.700
After I replace you,

03:09.540 --> 03:11.670
I'll be the master of Three Realms, and

03:12.660 --> 03:14.580
I will have supreme power.

03:15.620 --> 03:16.220
I will also have

03:16.220 --> 03:19.680
the girl that God of the Moonlight yearns for even when he died.

03:20.420 --> 03:22.420
Why can't I call myself like that?

03:24.620 --> 03:26.680
You are not allowed to touch Liu Shao.

03:34.020 --> 03:35.270
Not allowed?

03:36.380 --> 03:38.310
Unfortunately, it's not up to you.

03:39.660 --> 03:42.579
I'm afraid that at that time, Liu Shao will

03:43.340 --> 03:44.940
come into my arms without hesitation.

03:44.940 --> 03:45.980
How dare you!

03:52.610 --> 03:53.340
Luo Ge,

03:54.180 --> 03:56.380
it seems that you don't understand that

03:56.860 --> 03:59.590
a truly strong person shouldn't have a weakness.

04:20.220 --> 04:21.820
What's going on with the sky?

04:25.900 --> 04:30.230
Can Immortal Palace rain, thunder, and have lightning like the mortal world?

04:31.260 --> 04:31.920
Be careful.

04:44.460 --> 04:45.900
The thunder and lightning

04:45.900 --> 04:47.580
remind me of the scene where the evil spirit

04:47.580 --> 04:49.380
came out ten thousand years ago.

04:49.460 --> 04:50.409
Ten thousand years ago?

04:50.409 --> 04:51.300
That's right.

04:51.540 --> 04:53.340
I just transformed at that time.

04:53.380 --> 04:54.710
It looked like this too.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.680
Later, I found out that

04:56.820 --> 04:59.020
it was because the evil spirit came out.

04:59.180 --> 05:00.380
It was said that there was no sun in the mortal world

05:00.380 --> 05:01.700
for seven days,

05:02.060 --> 05:03.920
and everything stopped growing.

05:04.020 --> 05:06.020
If it weren't for the two immortals,

05:06.620 --> 05:07.380
Three Realms

05:07.380 --> 05:08.980
might have fallen into eternal night,

05:08.980 --> 05:09.900
and all beings

05:09.900 --> 05:11.210
would have been extinguished.

05:11.210 --> 05:12.580
Don't think too much.

05:12.740 --> 05:14.300
The evil spirit has been suppressed for ten thousand years.

05:14.300 --> 05:15.810
His power is no longer as strong as before.

05:15.810 --> 05:17.470
Immortal Luo Ge can handle it.

05:22.180 --> 05:22.740
Luo Ge.

05:24.020 --> 05:24.580
Luo Ge!

05:27.810 --> 05:29.380
Has Luo Ge been...

05:45.780 --> 05:46.580
No.

05:48.180 --> 05:50.640
I can't be controlled by that evil creature.

05:50.780 --> 05:52.040
I have to hang in there.

05:52.860 --> 05:54.420
I have to.

05:58.659 --> 05:59.980
Chaos has appeared.

06:01.580 --> 06:03.420
Luo Ge may have lost his mind.

06:06.140 --> 06:06.940
I...

06:07.780 --> 06:10.140
will hang in there.

06:15.290 --> 06:15.980
Luo Ge,

06:16.660 --> 06:17.810
hang in there.

06:51.500 --> 06:52.500
Why are you

06:53.140 --> 06:54.270
a little different?

06:54.340 --> 06:56.050
Immortal Palace is too boring.

06:56.050 --> 06:57.860
It's time to change it.

06:58.820 --> 07:00.340
I think this appearance

07:00.650 --> 07:02.140
suits Luo Ge.

07:03.900 --> 07:05.100
Besides,

07:05.820 --> 07:06.500
should we

07:07.370 --> 07:08.740
get married?

07:10.140 --> 07:10.940
Get married?

07:15.980 --> 07:16.850
I did ask Master Shang

07:16.850 --> 07:19.020
to prepare for it before,

07:19.460 --> 07:21.720
but many things have happened recently.

07:22.020 --> 07:24.080
Besides, Master Zhuo was petrified,

07:24.220 --> 07:26.820
and Master Shang is not in the mood to handle it,

07:27.300 --> 07:28.420
so

07:28.740 --> 07:30.070
this matter was put off.

07:30.620 --> 07:32.280
I've been waiting for so long.

07:33.540 --> 07:34.870
Why is it still delayed?

07:39.659 --> 07:40.540
So,

07:42.860 --> 07:44.920
how long are you going to hide from me?

07:52.220 --> 07:53.300
I'm still young.

07:53.540 --> 07:54.800
It's not strange for me

07:55.930 --> 07:57.340
not to get married.

07:57.860 --> 07:59.380
It is too late.

08:01.260 --> 08:02.060
We can't

08:02.940 --> 08:04.540
put this matter off anymore.

08:05.820 --> 08:07.480
How about holding the wedding

08:08.180 --> 08:09.300
tomorrow?

08:10.940 --> 08:12.660
Does it have to be in such a hurry?

08:12.660 --> 08:13.720
It is not in a hurry.

08:14.260 --> 08:16.300
I'll manage everything.

08:18.060 --> 08:19.660
I will tell Three Realms that

08:20.580 --> 08:21.840
the person I will marry

08:23.260 --> 08:25.860
is Luo Ge's favorite, Liu Shao.

09:01.820 --> 09:03.420
Do you remember this flower?

09:06.420 --> 09:07.460
Do you remember

09:07.940 --> 09:09.140
who made this flower?

09:11.900 --> 09:12.980
For one person,

09:13.980 --> 09:15.240
I froze the flower here

09:16.380 --> 09:17.710
and let it never wither.

09:19.020 --> 09:20.550
Now I want to use this flower

09:21.700 --> 09:23.500
to reflect that person's heart.

09:27.090 --> 09:28.220
You're right.

09:30.580 --> 09:32.130
Liu Shao is my weakness,

09:33.900 --> 09:35.500
but she is also my armor.

09:36.300 --> 09:37.900
You, some black energy, will never understand the courage

09:37.900 --> 09:39.460
a person can gain

09:40.380 --> 09:42.260
when loving someone.

09:43.290 --> 09:44.820
Ridiculous.

09:47.260 --> 09:48.300
That man said

09:49.170 --> 09:50.940
after experiencing thousands of tribulations

09:50.940 --> 09:52.540
through thousands of years,

09:53.020 --> 09:54.460
he only loves me.

09:56.660 --> 09:58.460
Even if I have experienced thousands of tribulations

09:58.460 --> 10:00.060
through thousands of years,

10:00.090 --> 10:01.460
you are still the only one

10:01.460 --> 10:02.700
I love.

10:33.180 --> 10:33.840
Liu Shao...

10:38.740 --> 10:39.570
You are Luo Ge.

10:40.140 --> 10:41.060
Liu Shao,

10:41.740 --> 10:43.180
it will appear anytime.

10:44.210 --> 10:45.540
I'm running out of time.

10:49.220 --> 10:50.420
You'll be fine.

10:50.980 --> 10:52.060
I'll find some other ways.

10:51.400 --> 10:55.940
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

10:52.980 --> 10:54.380
Everything will be fine.

10:55.620 --> 10:56.300
Okay.

10:57.580 --> 10:59.330
I'll try my best to protect my consciousness.

10:58.050 --> 11:02.800
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

11:01.060 --> 11:02.190
I'm waiting for you.

11:02.940 --> 11:03.940
You can make it.

11:03.310 --> 11:09.370
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

11:05.340 --> 11:06.270
What did you say?

11:06.420 --> 11:09.620
Luo Ge will be controlled by the evil creature at any time!

11:09.940 --> 11:10.940
The half of his heart

11:10.370 --> 11:16.350
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

11:11.860 --> 11:13.260
still leaves a disaster.

11:15.300 --> 11:16.960
Even Luo Ge can't suppress it?

11:17.340 --> 11:19.220
Luo Ge wants me to go to Marquis Wu Yang's mansion immediately

11:17.810 --> 11:22.650
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

11:19.220 --> 11:21.080
to build more Protection Spells.

11:21.900 --> 11:23.030
He asked you to do it.

11:23.180 --> 11:24.620
Isn't he the one who did all this?

11:24.230 --> 11:29.340
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

11:25.060 --> 11:27.720
I have injected my divine spirit into Moon Bell.

11:28.300 --> 11:30.380
Even if I am completely occupied by the evil spirit,

11:29.640 --> 11:35.690
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of the fire, they lost each other♫

11:30.900 --> 11:33.060
you can also activate the divine spirit in Wang Bell

11:33.060 --> 11:33.940
to wake me up

11:34.940 --> 11:36.860
so that we can seek a chance to kill the evil spirit.

11:36.100 --> 11:42.850
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

11:37.860 --> 11:38.260
Luo Ge!

11:39.780 --> 11:40.510
Are you okay?

11:43.300 --> 11:44.090
Besides,

11:44.700 --> 11:46.180
go to Marquis Wuyang's mansion immediately.

11:46.120 --> 11:49.170
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

11:47.060 --> 11:49.330
Set a new boundary with your immortal energy

11:49.330 --> 11:52.120
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

11:49.460 --> 11:51.580
to take a precaution in the mortal world.

11:51.580 --> 11:52.420
And then?

11:52.710 --> 11:55.260
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

11:52.980 --> 11:54.640
Then, you have to take the time

11:54.860 --> 11:56.540
to prepare to deal with the evil these days.

11:55.260 --> 11:58.850
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

11:58.260 --> 11:59.340
This time, Three Realms

11:59.200 --> 12:01.800
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

12:00.380 --> 12:01.300
count on you.

12:01.800 --> 12:06.230
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

12:05.180 --> 12:06.860
Luo Ge can't leave.

12:06.230 --> 12:12.820
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

12:07.540 --> 12:08.940
Xuan Ling Wood Boundary.

12:09.860 --> 12:10.770
You're right.

12:11.180 --> 12:13.500
Xuan Ling Wood can help him suppress the evil thing.

12:13.500 --> 12:15.540
But you will be tired then.

12:17.290 --> 12:18.180
Yes.

12:19.300 --> 12:21.360
Luo Ge has been standing in front of me

12:21.490 --> 12:23.570
all the time

12:24.850 --> 12:26.850
to protect me from the wind and rain.

12:27.540 --> 12:28.580
This time,

12:30.780 --> 12:32.940
I'll stand in front of Luo Ge

12:32.180 --> 12:34.710
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

12:34.300 --> 12:35.510
and clear the obstacles

12:35.510 --> 12:38.620
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

12:35.820 --> 12:37.380
for him.

12:38.840 --> 12:41.390
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

12:41.390 --> 12:45.800
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

12:45.800 --> 12:49.150
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

12:49.170 --> 12:52.580
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

12:52.580 --> 12:59.350
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

13:15.220 --> 13:17.080
Demon King, please wait a moment.

13:19.690 --> 13:20.380
Immortal,

13:20.580 --> 13:22.580
Demon King in White wants to see you.

13:39.210 --> 13:39.900
Immortal,

13:40.140 --> 13:42.140
Demon King in White wants to see you.

13:46.260 --> 13:47.060
Let him in.

13:50.700 --> 13:51.830
Demon King, please.

14:13.050 --> 14:13.860
Have a seat.

14:20.340 --> 14:21.400
What is the matter?

14:26.860 --> 14:29.190
I've been planning to come and apologize,

14:29.420 --> 14:30.620
and stop in to check whether you

14:30.620 --> 14:31.480
are doing well.

14:34.740 --> 14:35.300
I'm fine.

14:36.500 --> 14:38.030
Thank you for your concern.

14:40.940 --> 14:41.410
Luo Ge.

14:44.260 --> 14:45.390
The teacup is empty.

14:51.740 --> 14:53.070
Is there anything wrong

14:55.260 --> 14:56.390
with the half heart?

15:05.570 --> 15:06.100
He Na,

15:09.100 --> 15:10.900
the Luo Ge you will meet next time

15:12.860 --> 15:14.390
might not be the real Luo Ge.

15:17.860 --> 15:19.460
Is the evil spirit really...

15:19.900 --> 15:20.300
Yes.

15:22.140 --> 15:23.270
I didn't expect that

15:24.780 --> 15:26.110
the so-called Immortal

15:27.500 --> 15:30.030
would be the biggest trouble in Three Realms.

15:32.940 --> 15:33.730
I hope

15:35.060 --> 15:36.620
when I lose my mind,

15:37.740 --> 15:40.140
Liu Shao will be as brave as God of the Sun who

15:40.860 --> 15:41.720
has the courage

15:42.740 --> 15:44.200
and the ability to stop me.

15:45.860 --> 15:47.860
Although she's trying to find a way,

15:48.940 --> 15:51.070
I'm afraid that the time is limited and

15:51.500 --> 15:52.900
she won't make it in time.

15:58.060 --> 15:59.260
She has the talent,

16:00.340 --> 16:01.400
but she needs time.

16:03.860 --> 16:05.590
There is a breakthrough on her.

16:07.100 --> 16:09.100
Maybe it can solve this completely.

16:09.940 --> 16:11.070
What breakthrough?

16:12.540 --> 16:13.940
Clear Vine.

16:18.500 --> 16:19.620
Clear Vine

16:20.340 --> 16:22.660
hides in the Qiansha Illusion in Bone Melting Pool.

16:22.660 --> 16:24.620
Clear Vine likes to eat evil spirits.

16:24.620 --> 16:25.860
If it can be used as medicine,

16:25.860 --> 16:27.090
it can stimulate the spirit

16:27.090 --> 16:28.620
and improve people's cultivation.

16:28.620 --> 16:30.820
But Qiansha Illusion makes people confused.

16:30.820 --> 16:32.820
One can't enter unless he is a deity.

16:38.740 --> 16:40.380
Then you can go and get it now.

16:41.220 --> 16:43.280
There's still evil energy in my body.

16:43.860 --> 16:46.120
The Vine may treat me as an evil creature.

16:47.940 --> 16:49.940
Water energy can stop evil spirits.

16:50.820 --> 16:51.820
If I am not enough,

16:52.060 --> 16:52.990
there is also Fu.

17:18.740 --> 17:19.740
Go and see Fu.

17:23.020 --> 17:24.480
Come and protect me later.

17:39.980 --> 17:40.540
Brother,

17:41.620 --> 17:43.480
I know you're disappointed in me.

17:44.020 --> 17:45.620
I made a huge mistake.

17:49.260 --> 17:50.660
But Luo Ning is innocent.

17:52.140 --> 17:53.100
I hope you

17:54.460 --> 17:56.120
can bring her immortal energy

17:57.740 --> 17:59.180
out of Bone Melting Pool.

18:03.500 --> 18:04.900
I'm willing to serve

18:06.220 --> 18:08.020
in Bone Melting Pool until I die.

18:12.380 --> 18:13.980
You are not qualified to die.

18:14.340 --> 18:15.500
You ruined Luo Ning,

18:15.900 --> 18:16.970
Melody race,

18:17.140 --> 18:18.060
and Three Realms.

18:18.060 --> 18:19.340
How can you die?

18:29.540 --> 18:31.000
I can't hold on any longer.

18:32.620 --> 18:34.020
After I die,

18:35.180 --> 18:37.500
you'll be the King of Melody race.

18:39.500 --> 18:40.740
You can't die here.

18:43.300 --> 18:45.430
You must live with Luo Ning's yearning

18:46.540 --> 18:48.860
to atone for your heinous crimes.

18:56.660 --> 18:58.660
Luo Ning cares about Luo Ge the most.

19:00.060 --> 19:01.420
Give him your water energy

19:01.420 --> 19:02.260
with me

19:05.060 --> 19:06.920
and help him find the instrument.

19:08.340 --> 19:09.940
This protection will be counted

19:09.940 --> 19:12.600
as the first thing you do to atone for your crime.

19:32.810 --> 19:34.260
Fu and I will protect you.

19:34.540 --> 19:35.070
Besides,

19:35.460 --> 19:37.260
take this Water Energy Lantern.

19:37.620 --> 19:39.620
It will connect with your inner energy.

19:39.620 --> 19:40.750
If a spirit appears,

19:41.300 --> 19:42.100
it will flash.

19:43.180 --> 19:43.660
By then,

19:44.260 --> 19:46.460
Fu and I will try our best to get you back.

19:46.740 --> 19:48.870
You have to be careful all the time too.

20:20.420 --> 20:22.220
I've entered Qiansha Illusion.

20:23.380 --> 20:25.910
Pay close attention to Water Energy Lantern.

21:11.740 --> 21:12.300
Brother,

21:12.660 --> 21:13.100
look.

21:49.380 --> 21:50.310
It's testing me.

21:54.380 --> 21:55.100
Brother,

21:55.340 --> 21:57.340
Water Energy Lantern is weakening.

21:58.860 --> 21:59.450
Oh no.

21:59.780 --> 22:00.510
It found out.

22:02.740 --> 22:03.220
Luo Ge,

22:03.500 --> 22:04.180
come back!

22:05.380 --> 22:05.860
Luo Ge!

22:08.860 --> 22:09.860
Add water energy.

22:11.900 --> 22:12.540
Luo Ge.

22:29.700 --> 22:30.260
Luo Ge.

22:31.460 --> 22:32.020
Luo Ge!

23:08.380 --> 23:09.510
It was an emergency.

23:10.260 --> 23:11.860
How did you get out of danger?

23:14.580 --> 23:15.440
It was Luo Ning.

23:16.570 --> 23:19.340
Luo Ning's immortal energy also entered the Boundary.

23:19.340 --> 23:20.180
She saved me.

23:22.540 --> 23:23.940
There was a beam of light.

23:24.620 --> 23:27.020
It lighted up the entire Protection Spell.

23:27.060 --> 23:28.520
The Vine disappeared too.

23:31.300 --> 23:32.430
Let go of my brother.

23:51.340 --> 23:53.420
Later, the Vine recognized me as Immortal,

23:53.420 --> 23:55.420
and that's why it gave the Vine to me.

23:57.940 --> 23:58.570
Fu.

24:08.740 --> 24:09.340
Go back.

24:10.140 --> 24:11.580
The future of Immortal Palace is unpredictable.

24:11.580 --> 24:13.060
Let Fu stay away from trouble

24:13.060 --> 24:14.590
so that he can save his life.

24:15.260 --> 24:16.720
It is also Luo Ning's wish.

24:22.220 --> 24:22.820
Thank you.

24:24.140 --> 24:25.460
I will teach him well.

24:26.220 --> 24:28.220
I won't let him make mistakes again.

24:42.820 --> 24:45.420
Take good care of my sister's immortal energy.

24:49.210 --> 24:49.740
Let's go.

25:17.820 --> 25:19.620
Immortal Master, you're awake.

25:20.620 --> 25:23.500
I dreamed of Fairy Luo Ning just now.

25:25.900 --> 25:27.340
How long did I sleep?

25:28.340 --> 25:29.940
Did she come to see me?

25:32.460 --> 25:33.770
You don't remember.

25:34.100 --> 25:37.020
Fairy has passed away.

25:48.380 --> 25:50.300
What have I done?

25:59.060 --> 26:01.020
I will give you enough power

26:01.020 --> 26:02.880
to let you overturn Three Realms.

26:29.580 --> 26:30.490
What did I do?

26:31.970 --> 26:33.620
What did I do?

26:38.650 --> 26:42.180
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

26:41.780 --> 26:43.020
As long as the person who cast Protection Spell is alive,

26:43.020 --> 26:44.570
the boundary will be solid.

26:44.900 --> 26:46.540
The boundary my brother built is very solid.

26:46.540 --> 26:48.540
Why do you have to build another one?

26:51.380 --> 26:52.820
Is there something wrong

26:53.460 --> 26:54.940
with my brother's body?

27:03.180 --> 27:05.740
It's been ten thousand years.

27:07.260 --> 27:10.300
We've finally come this far.

27:13.700 --> 27:15.860
Can Ge and the Liu Shao

27:16.740 --> 27:19.140
change the fate between

27:19.140 --> 27:21.270
God of the Sun and God of the Moonlight?

27:22.860 --> 27:24.100
It seems that

27:24.490 --> 27:27.900
I need to tell Liu Shao something.

27:29.220 --> 27:30.550
Don't do anything evil.

27:31.020 --> 27:32.020
Do good deeds.

27:32.860 --> 27:33.390
Luo Ning,

27:34.420 --> 27:36.280
are these what you want to tell me?

27:36.580 --> 27:38.040
Now I finally understand.

27:41.260 --> 27:42.860
General Fu is looking for me.

27:44.260 --> 27:45.420
Mr. Tai, let me ask you.

27:45.420 --> 27:46.680
Can my brother recover

27:47.660 --> 27:49.390
if I take away his water energy?

27:51.170 --> 27:52.060
General,

27:52.060 --> 27:53.380
His Majesty only has

27:53.380 --> 27:56.380
Water Spirit Vein and 1000 years of cultivation left.

27:57.420 --> 28:00.620
He barely lives.

28:02.290 --> 28:03.820
My brother must hate me now

28:04.700 --> 28:06.630
and doesn't want to see me anymore.

28:07.300 --> 28:08.260
General Fu,

28:08.740 --> 28:10.540
don't say that.

28:11.700 --> 28:12.460
His Majesty

28:12.860 --> 28:14.540
didn't blame you.

28:15.300 --> 28:16.300
He just hopes that

28:16.620 --> 28:17.620
one day,

28:17.620 --> 28:19.350
you can become a good Demon King

28:19.860 --> 28:22.540
and lead Melody Race well.

28:22.740 --> 28:23.860
Then His Majesty

28:23.930 --> 28:25.020
will be relieved.

28:25.500 --> 28:26.830
Become a good Demon King

28:27.730 --> 28:29.580
while stepping on my brother's body.

28:29.580 --> 28:31.020
General Fu,

28:31.820 --> 28:33.740
I know it's difficult.

28:34.700 --> 28:35.460
But

28:35.820 --> 28:37.380
there is no other way.

28:37.740 --> 28:40.860
Why don't you just follow His Majesty's wish,

28:40.860 --> 28:41.420
OK?

28:44.100 --> 28:46.360
I will fulfill his and Luo Ning's wishes.

28:46.820 --> 28:47.980
But in my heart,

28:48.860 --> 28:50.720
only my brother is the Demon King,

28:50.820 --> 28:52.260
the only one in the world.

28:53.340 --> 28:54.670
No matter what it takes,

28:55.620 --> 28:56.780
I will protect him.

29:01.140 --> 29:05.200
Even if I have to use my blood and primordial spirit to pave the way for him,

29:05.420 --> 29:06.220
I will

29:06.980 --> 29:07.940
protect him.

29:15.900 --> 29:18.460
Immortal Master, are you looking for me?

29:21.660 --> 29:22.740
Do you know

29:23.300 --> 29:26.980
why I always thwart you and Ge?

29:27.540 --> 29:28.900
You worry that

29:30.020 --> 29:31.950
I'll affect Luo Ge's cultivation.

29:32.620 --> 29:33.460
Wrong.

29:34.820 --> 29:37.100
It's because you resemble her too much.

29:38.260 --> 29:39.300
Back then,

29:40.580 --> 29:43.020
if she hadn't shown her kindness,

29:43.260 --> 29:46.930
the evil spirit wouldn't be eternal.

29:50.020 --> 29:51.060
God of the Sun...

29:56.700 --> 29:58.960
I can no longer suppress the evil spirit.

30:00.170 --> 30:03.140
Is the tragedy from ten thousand years ago going to happen again?

30:03.140 --> 30:04.820
I will try my best

30:05.340 --> 30:06.870
to improve my cultivation.

30:07.060 --> 30:08.460
and seal the evil spirit.

30:09.500 --> 30:10.500
Before that,

30:11.540 --> 30:13.140
I'll try to deal with the evil

30:14.580 --> 30:15.740
to protect myself

30:16.620 --> 30:17.540
and others.

30:27.100 --> 30:29.100
It was wrong ten thousand years ago.

30:34.300 --> 30:35.300
Do you want to

30:36.500 --> 30:38.360
let Liu Shao be like God of the Sun?

30:40.380 --> 30:41.330
After all,

30:43.780 --> 30:44.900
in your eyes,

30:45.700 --> 30:46.660
I'm just

30:47.210 --> 30:48.610
a shadow of God of the Sun.

30:50.170 --> 30:51.830
I'm just worried that you will

30:52.050 --> 30:52.980
repeat

30:53.980 --> 30:56.420
the same mistake as God of the Sun.

30:57.780 --> 30:58.660
Liu Shao,

30:59.060 --> 31:01.820
there's something you need to know.

31:02.300 --> 31:03.020
Luo Ge,

31:03.620 --> 31:04.700
you and I are one.

31:05.260 --> 31:06.520
But have you forgotten

31:06.820 --> 31:08.100
who lives with us?

31:12.380 --> 31:14.660
Immortal Master, you mean

31:15.100 --> 31:16.960
I will be the same as God of the Sun.

31:23.140 --> 31:24.660
The evil spirit appears.

31:25.380 --> 31:27.310
Three Realms will be in chaos soon.

31:28.260 --> 31:31.390
You are the only instrument left by God of the Moonlight.

31:32.020 --> 31:34.140
Can you give me some hints?

31:36.810 --> 31:38.340
Actually, few people

31:38.620 --> 31:40.860
know that part of the story.

31:41.900 --> 31:42.940
Moon Sword,

31:43.860 --> 31:45.380
what happened back then?

31:46.580 --> 31:47.860
You must know it.

31:59.780 --> 32:01.340
God of the Sun

32:01.340 --> 32:04.100
could have killed the evil spirit with her Crown Wheel,

32:04.100 --> 32:05.660
but she didn't.

32:06.020 --> 32:07.580
Why not?

32:16.180 --> 32:18.540
At that time, God of the Sun tried to

32:18.540 --> 32:20.460
dispel the evil spirit in God of the Moonlight,

32:20.460 --> 32:23.020
but it only made God of the Moonlight more seriously injured.

32:23.020 --> 32:25.060
It seemed that before the evil spirit was cleared,

32:25.060 --> 32:27.140
God of the Moonlight would die first.

32:27.700 --> 32:29.360
What's more dangerous is that

32:29.740 --> 32:32.220
as the spiritual power of God of the Moonlight got weak,

32:32.220 --> 32:34.980
the evil spirit got stronger.

32:35.380 --> 32:37.330
In desperation,

32:37.330 --> 32:38.660
God of the Moonlight asked

32:38.660 --> 32:41.300
God of the Sun to kill himself.

32:44.540 --> 32:46.220
To eliminate the evil spirit,

32:46.700 --> 32:48.360
God of the Moonlight must die.

32:48.500 --> 32:50.020
There was no other way.

32:51.500 --> 32:54.820
But God of the Sun doesn't want God of the Sun to disappear.

32:55.460 --> 32:58.330
To bring peace to Three Realms,

32:59.810 --> 33:03.380
to protect the spirit of God of the Moonlight,

33:03.900 --> 33:05.300
she decided to

33:05.980 --> 33:08.460
fight with her life.

33:23.860 --> 33:24.810
Moon Sword.

33:25.860 --> 33:27.300
Exactly.

33:30.050 --> 33:31.460
What are you doing?

33:32.370 --> 33:33.940
You can't kill it like this.

33:34.890 --> 33:36.220
I can't use Crown Wheel.

33:37.660 --> 33:39.720
Crown Wheel will turn you into ashes.

33:41.660 --> 33:43.290
I can't let you disappear.

33:44.020 --> 33:44.940
So,

33:46.180 --> 33:47.580
I took your sword.

33:48.740 --> 33:49.980
It will protect you.

33:54.010 --> 33:56.420
Do you know what you are doing?

33:58.180 --> 33:59.180
I know.

34:04.700 --> 34:06.410
Put down the sword.

34:09.219 --> 34:10.420
Put down the sword.

34:18.300 --> 34:20.739
Even if I am devoured and killed by Moon Sword,

34:20.739 --> 34:22.460
I will let you live.

35:05.850 --> 35:07.380
The evil spirit was suppressed.

35:07.380 --> 35:08.860
Moon Sword was sealed.

35:09.820 --> 35:13.820
God of the Sun died due to the devouring.

35:15.140 --> 35:16.580
The strike

35:17.980 --> 35:20.180
with all her strength

35:20.570 --> 35:23.900
broke the heart of God of the Moonlight into two.

35:24.460 --> 35:28.320
One half with the evil spirit was sealed under Four Seasons Monument.

35:28.540 --> 35:30.020
The other half

35:30.020 --> 35:33.340
which keeps God of the Moonlight's consciousness

35:33.500 --> 35:34.900
turned into Ge.

35:36.060 --> 35:38.900
Then God of the Moonlight remains.

35:39.860 --> 35:43.620
But in the end, she couldn't wait for Ge to transform.

35:44.660 --> 35:48.060
Then, there was no God of the Sun in Three Realms.

35:49.180 --> 35:50.940
Because of her love,

35:51.380 --> 35:53.580
the evil spirit remains for ten thousand years.

35:53.580 --> 35:54.580
And Ge

35:54.940 --> 35:58.740
was born because of love.

36:51.420 --> 36:52.980
That is the truth.

36:57.580 --> 36:59.930
So God of the Sun didn't choose to kill God of the Moonlight.

36:59.930 --> 37:01.540
And I met Luo Ge

37:02.420 --> 37:04.130
because of her love.

37:07.820 --> 37:08.860
Liu Shao,

37:09.460 --> 37:12.220
only you can save Three Realms now.

37:13.100 --> 37:15.560
But I can't even break the seal of Sun Spirit.

37:17.060 --> 37:19.180
What else should I do?

37:20.500 --> 37:21.340
Liu Shao,

37:21.940 --> 37:23.470
it is not an accident for you

37:24.220 --> 37:26.100
to be in Immortal Palace.

37:26.980 --> 37:29.860
Since you stepped into Immortal Palace,

37:30.460 --> 37:32.500
I felt that she was back.

37:32.530 --> 37:36.570
♫The wind is getting slower, while the pear flowers are dropping♫

37:33.940 --> 37:36.020
Ten thousand years have passed.

37:36.900 --> 37:39.940
She seemed to have left for just a moment.

37:37.030 --> 37:40.590
♫The silver color is cold and sharp♫

37:45.210 --> 37:49.050
♫On the top of Heaven and between reincarnation♫

37:47.850 --> 37:49.140
Immortal Master.

37:49.590 --> 37:53.100
♫The moon is like snow♫

37:51.660 --> 37:52.340
Liu Shao,

37:54.180 --> 37:56.540
you are the only one who can end this

37:57.790 --> 38:01.840
♫I carve our appointment in three days between my eyebrows♫

38:01.930 --> 38:03.900
It seems that the end of this catastrophe

38:02.210 --> 38:06.090
♫I walk through time with you♫

38:05.020 --> 38:08.220
is to let Liu Shao finish what God of the Sun didn't finish.

38:09.060 --> 38:12.550
♫On the day when seas sink♫

38:12.260 --> 38:13.340
Luo Ge.

38:12.930 --> 38:21.540
♫When the moon never rests, the mortal world♫

38:14.760 --> 38:16.890
I will soon lose my mind completely.

38:17.500 --> 38:18.700
God of the Moonlight.

38:20.410 --> 38:21.980
God of the Sun and I agreed that

38:21.890 --> 38:28.310
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

38:22.660 --> 38:23.820
three days later,

38:24.340 --> 38:26.340
if the evil spirit is not eliminated,

38:26.340 --> 38:28.060
she will kill me.

38:28.310 --> 38:31.040
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

38:29.940 --> 38:33.580
Actually, I know that

38:31.040 --> 38:34.520
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

38:34.520 --> 38:40.770
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

38:36.820 --> 38:38.500
she wants me to live,

38:40.770 --> 38:47.410
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

38:41.060 --> 38:42.220
and she can't do it.

38:47.980 --> 38:49.410
But she is wrong.

38:49.980 --> 38:52.020
I must find a suitable person

38:53.170 --> 38:54.500
to carry Sun Spirit

38:54.980 --> 38:57.170
so that she can eliminate the evil spirit

38:57.170 --> 38:59.180
in ten thousand years.

39:08.580 --> 39:10.640
I am the one who will change your fate.

39:11.380 --> 39:12.910
If you leave your fate to me,

39:13.500 --> 39:17.040
♫The wind is getting slower, while the pear flowers are dropping♫

39:13.780 --> 39:15.910
I'll give you three days of happiness.

39:17.970 --> 39:20.980
♫The silver color is cold and sharp♫

39:18.020 --> 39:19.980
Okay, I promise you.

39:21.180 --> 39:22.540
So Liu Shao

39:24.020 --> 39:26.120
is the one chosen by God of the Moonlight.

39:26.120 --> 39:29.750
♫On the top of Heaven and between reincarnation♫

39:30.550 --> 39:33.790
♫The moon is like snow♫

39:31.620 --> 39:33.930
I've told you the method.

39:34.300 --> 39:35.780
As for what to do,

39:36.420 --> 39:38.420
you decide it yourself.

39:38.690 --> 39:42.440
♫I carve our appointment in three days between my eyebrows♫

39:43.190 --> 39:47.090
♫I walk through time with you♫

39:44.420 --> 39:45.420
So

39:46.260 --> 39:47.780
the three-day promise

39:49.290 --> 39:51.170
shoulders all living beings.

39:50.270 --> 39:53.410
♫On the day when seas sink♫

39:53.850 --> 40:02.510
♫When the moon never rests, the mortal world♫

40:01.620 --> 40:02.540
Liu Shao,

40:02.880 --> 40:08.920
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

40:03.420 --> 40:05.180
don't forget our promise

40:06.820 --> 40:08.460
Remember your mission

40:09.200 --> 40:12.090
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

40:12.090 --> 40:15.410
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

40:15.570 --> 40:21.840
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

40:21.840 --> 40:28.770
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

40:29.370 --> 40:32.530
♫You left my heart. You are my fate♫

40:32.530 --> 40:35.370
♫You are like dreams as if you disappear♫

40:35.700 --> 40:38.650
♫Two sides are round. You are like the moon at 11 pm♫

40:38.850 --> 40:41.100
♫You are my fate♫

40:41.280 --> 40:46.620
♫Look at the three realms. Look at the wilderness♫

40:41.460 --> 40:42.540
In that case,

40:43.820 --> 40:44.620
God of the Sun,

40:45.700 --> 40:46.540
I'll do

40:46.760 --> 40:49.070
♫Our old fate has become a cocoon♫

40:47.820 --> 40:49.070
what you couldn't do for you.

40:49.070 --> 40:56.670
♫The rest of life is no match  for a second♫

40:50.260 --> 40:51.580
I'll help you solve

40:52.900 --> 40:54.030
what you regretted.

40:55.220 --> 40:56.670
I will protect all beings in Three Realms

40:56.670 --> 41:02.660
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

40:57.100 --> 40:59.100
and the heart of God of the Moonlight

41:00.020 --> 41:01.340
for you.

41:02.880 --> 41:05.830
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

41:05.830 --> 41:08.900
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

41:09.160 --> 41:15.520
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

41:15.520 --> 41:21.370
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

41:21.840 --> 41:30.850
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫
